        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>3 5 3 2</choice_text>
          <commentary>ㄱ은 4개, ㄹ은 4개이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>4 5 3 4</choice_text>
          <commentary>ㄱ 4개, ㄴ 5개, ㄷ 3개, ㄹ 4개이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
